  "site_description": "Requests yourlore.dev's Worker counts (XC-120), one per request, cookieless, under one fixed id for the whole site, carrying only a coarse agent family taken from the User-Agent. They reach the relay only through its binding-only SiteEvents entrypoint, never the public /events route; lore/usage.py never sends them.",
